flowchart TD
S([Start]) --> L["Local part: require valid non-dot character"]
L --> P["Consume allowed local characters"]
P -->|single @ after valid local part| D["Domain: require alphanumeric"]
D --> G["Consume domain label"]
G -->|dot after valid label| D
G -->|end; final label ≥2 letters and prior dot exists| A((Accept))
P -->|malformed dot / invalid / extra @| R[["Reject"]]
D -->|invalid / empty label| R
G -->|invalid / malformed| R
